      "proposal_id": "PROP-005",
      "reason_not_selected": "Provides a sex‑specific estimate but does not formally test heterogeneity, offering lower scientific value (MEDIUM information gain) compared to a formal interaction test."
    },
    {
      "proposal_id": "PROP-008",
      "reason_not_selected": "Tests child‑presence moderation, which is relevant but secondary to the primary sex‑difference question and adds a covariate not central to the ranking uncertainty."
    },
    {
      "proposal_id": "PROP-009",
      "reason_not_selected": "Tests sex heterogeneity for leisure, which is informative, yet sleep is the outcome with the strongest negative point estimate, making PROP-003 more directly tied to the core uncertainty."
    }
  ],
